# scratch/ holds the verification trail for the Mustafar rounds: what each round was
# briefed to do, what it was gated against, and what came back. That record is committed.
#
# Three things are kept out of it, because this repo is destined for a public push:
#
#   *.jsonl          raw model-transcript output from the gate runs (~3.3 MB). The verdict
#                    is what matters and it is captured in terra-verdict.txt / the round
#                    reports; the transcript itself is noise and is regenerable.
#   *.stf.dump.txt   strings extracted from the retail SOE client .stf files. Read them,
#                    cite them, do not redistribute them.
#   *.err, *-err.txt stderr spill from dispatch (sandbox-policy rejections and the like),
#                    no evidentiary value.
#
# Drafts are also excluded: once a CANDIDATE or STAGED file lands it exists in the tree
# under its real name, and keeping a second copy here only invites editing the wrong one.

*.jsonl
*.stf.dump.txt
*.err
*-err.txt
*.CANDIDATE.lua
*.STAGED.lua
